Property Default Description <code>PumpThreadName</code> <code>null</code> → <code>HandyWindow-&lt;Title&gt;</code> Name of the pump thread. <code>CustomWindowOptions</code> <code>null</code> Overrides the whole <code>WindowOptions</code>. <p><code>with</code> expressions</p> <p>Because it's a record, tweaking a default is trivial:</p> <pre><code>var cfg = WindowConfiguration.Default with
{
    Title = "Chat",
    Size = new SKSize(420, 700),
    IsResizable = false,
    Icon = SKImage.FromEncodedData("Assets/chat.png")
};
</code></pre>
